{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在內蒙古阿魯科爾沁草原，逾千戶牧民帶著八萬多頭牲畜，向水草更豐美的夏季牧場遷徙，延續有千年歷史的遊牧傳統。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NMG.GRAZING.MTV.0701-0720_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026HMsajJNnSt1784510946.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NMG.GRAZING.MTV.0701-0720_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T02:13:56.696165+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":53,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}